Good point, but I tend to regard care for tools as a given 
for characters familiar with those tools.  When you say that 
a fighter has failed to take care of weapons or armor, or that
a magician has failed to take care of wands, robes, and staves, 
that's just insulting the character.  OTOH, it might be sensible
for wizards to have to take special (player awareness required) 
steps to take care of weapons, or for fighters to have to take 
special steps to take care of wands and scrolls.  I will consider 
it. 

